<title>UK: Aston Villa public shr offer raises 12.58 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Aston Villa public shr offer raises 12.58 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British soccer club Aston Villa Plc said on Wednesday it raised about 12.58 million stg in its public share offering for its flotation on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
